# Host-side cron jobs (optional). Install with:   crontab -e   and paste the lines you want.
# Check with: crontab -l
#
# The server's own cron jobs (daily backup, daily reboot, auto-update, deleting old
# backups) run INSIDE the container and are configured in compose.yaml — see README.
#
# ┌ minute ┌ hour ┌ day-of-month ┌ month ┌ day-of-week
# │        │      │              │       │
# Upload last night's backup (made at 00:00) to Google Drive at 00:30.
# Needs rclone with a remote named "gdrive" — see README "Upload backups to Google Drive".
30 0 * * * rclone copy "$HOME/palworld-docker/palworld/backups" gdrive: --max-age 24h --log-file "$HOME/rclone-palworld.log"
